   "summary": "The official dark theme for the awesome ... ",
   "description": "<p><b>The official dark theme for the awesome <a href=\"https://draculatheme.com/\">dracula color palette</a></b><br /><br /><b>Installation:</b><br /><br />1.- Extract the zip file to the themes directory i.e.   ~/.themes/  or  /usr/share/themes/ (create it  if necessary).<br /><br />2.- To set the theme in Gnome, run the following commands in Terminal.<br /><br /></p><pre><code>gsettings set org.gnome.desktop.interface gtk-theme Dracula</code></pre><br /><pre><code>gsettings set org.gnome.desktop.wm.preferences theme Dracula</code></pre><br /><br />or Change via distribution specific tweaktool.<br />------------------<br /><br /><b>Donations</b><br />The DRacula theme is available for free. if you're enjoying the Dracula theme, feel free to buy me a cofee, I would be so grateful <img src=\"https://www.pling.com/media/emoticons/happy.png\" alt=\"\" /> <a href=\"https://www.paypal.me/EliverLara/\"></a><a href=\"https://www.paypal.me/EliverLara/\">https://www.paypal.me/EliverLara/</a><br /><br />------------------<br /><b>Bugs and Issues </b>:<br />If you find a bug, please report it to the github issue tracker:<br /><br /><a href=\"https://github.com/dracula/gtk/issues\">Dracula issues</a>",
